AB  - Bronchoscopy is a very common tool for diagnosis and therapeutic purposes in 
      dealing with diseases of the lungs and the airways. Thankfully, a multitude of 
      new technologies have made it more accessible for the use of physicians. This 
      article is a review of the indication of bronchoscopy as it is being used today 
      for a variety of chest pathologies.
